        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: WrestleMania XXX\n- Places: Mercedes-Benz Superdome, New Orleans, Louisiana\n- Organizations: New Orleans Saints, National Football League\n- Events: Sugar Bowl, New Orleans Bowl\n- Products: \"Legacy\"\n- People: Eminem\n\nFacts:\n- WrestleMania XXX took place on April 6, 2014, at the Mercedes-Benz Superdome in New Orleans, Louisiana.\n- The Mercedes-Benz Superdome primarily serves as the home venue for the New Orleans Saints of the National Football League.\n- The Mercedes-Benz Superdome is also the home stadium for the Sugar Bowl and the New Orleans Bowl in college football.\n- \"Legacy,\" a song by Eminem, became one of the official theme songs of WrestleMania XXX.",
